 "content": [
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "If you don't mind I also have questions about your art? 1. What brush(s) do you use? And 2. What do your layers look like?"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "🥭"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "i dont mind at all 🥭!! i'll take any opportunity i can to shill for my favorite brush in the whole wide world: jens claessens' The Best Brush aka his chalk brush, which i use a modified version of for every single part of my painterly process (sketching, flats, rendering, detailing, etc. this thing is a fucking beast)\nthough i prefer the triangle brush for \"pencil sketch\" stuff. like my gale anime girl art!\nthe dylpixel circle brush with no pressure is what i call my \"mspaint\" brush, and its what i use to doodle and/or lay down really quick ideas\nthe quick lasso eraser is my only eraser and my god. once you beat the learning curve theres no going back from this thing 🥴",
   "formatting": [
    {
